{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":10000,"url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230225/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/focus/iran/chronology-of-key-events"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://web.archive.org/web/20230225/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/focus/iran/chronology-of-key-events:\n**-2022-**\n\n**NOVEMBER 2022**\n\n**16 November 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**In his instroductory statement to the Agency's Board of Governors, IAEA Director General  Rafael Grossi provided an update on the Agency's verification and monitoring activities in Iran. [Story](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/iaea-director-general-briefs-board-of-governors-cop27-ukraine-and-iran) | [Director General Statement](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-16-november-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20230303191851/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720303734818) | [Photo Gallery: Press Briefing](https://web.archive.org/web/20230303191851/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720303719816) | [Media Advisory](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-16-18-november-2022), 11 November 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/govinf2022-22.pdf), 3 October 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/govinf2022-23.pdf), 10 October 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/gov2022-62.pdf), 10 November 2022 |[IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/gov2022-63.pdf), 10 November 2022\n\n**SEPTEMBER 2022**\n\n**12 September 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**In his instroductory statement to the Agency's Board of Governors, IAEA Director General  Rafael Grossi provided an update on the Agency's verification and monitoring activities in Iran. [Story](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-12-september-2022) | [Director General Statement](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-12-september-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20230303191851/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720302049078) | [Media Advisory](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-12-16-september-2022), 9 September 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-13.pdf), 8 June 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-14.pdf), 9 June 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-15.pdf), 20 June 2022 |[IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-16.pdf), 9 July 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-17.pdf), 3 August 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-18.pdf), 29 August 2022 | [IAEA Boad Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-19.pdf), 31 August 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/gov2022-39.pdf), 7 September 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/gov2022-42.pdf), 7 September 2022\n\n**JUNE 2022**\n\n**8 June 2022. IAEA Board Adopts Resolution on Iran.** The IAEA Board of Governors adopted a resolution urging Iran to cooperate with the Agency. [Resolution](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-34.pdf)\n\n**6 June 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**The IAEA cannot confirm the correctness and completeness of Iran’s declarations under its Comprehensive Safeguards Agreement, Director General Rafael M. Grossi told the IAEA's Board of Governors. [Story](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/grossi-expresses-concern-to-iaea-board-about-safeguards-in-iran-nuclear-safety-security-and-safeguards-at-zaporizhzhya-nuclear-power-plant-in-ukraine) | [Director General Statement](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-6-june-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20230303191851/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720299573244) | [Media Advisory](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-6-june), 2 June 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-26.pdf), 30 May 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-24.pdf), 30 May 2022 and [Corrigendum](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-24c1.pdf), 6 June 2022 || [IAEA Board Report,](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-10.pdf) 16 April 2022 |  [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-11.pdf), 14 April 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-10.pdf), 6 April 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-8.pdf), 16 March 2022\n\n**MARCH 2022**\n\n**7 and 8 March 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**Mr Grossi briefed the Board on his negotiations in Tehran on Saturday and on the series of actions agreed regarding the clarification and resolution of safeguards issues the Agency's Board identified in November 2021 and called on Iran to resolve. [Story](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/framework-for-the-safety-and-security-of-ukraines-nuclear-power-plants-must-be-agreed-iaea-director-general-tells-board-of-governors) | [Director General Statement](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-7-march-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20230303191851/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720297182816) | [Media Advisory](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-7-11-march-2022), 6 March 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/03/gov2022-5.pdf), 5 March 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/03/gov2022-4.pdf), 3 March 2022\n\n**5 March 2022. Joint Statement by HE Mr Mohammad Eslami, Vice-President and President of the Atomic Energy Organization of Iran, and HE Mr Rafael Grossi, Director General of the International Atomic Energy Agency****.**The Vice-President of the Islamic Republic of Iran and President of the Atomic Energy Organization of Iran (AEOI) and the Director General of the International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) agreed on the following Joint Statement for the clarification of the issues mentioned in GOV/2021/52 of 17 November 2021. [Press Release](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/joint-statement-by-he-mr-mohammad-eslami-vice-president-and-president-of-the-atomic-energy-organization-of-iran-and-he-mr-rafael-grossi-director-general-of-the-international-atomic-energy-agency)\n\n**-2021-**\n\n**DECEMBER 2021**\n\n**15 December 2021. IAEA and Iran Reach Agreement on Replacing Surveillance Cameras at Karaj Facility.**The International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) will soon install new surveillance cameras at Iran’s Karaj centrifuge component manufacturing workshop under an agreement reached today by Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi and the Head of the Atomic Energy Organization of Iran, Mohammad Eslami. [Press Release](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/iaea-and-iran-reach-agreement-on-replacing-surveillance-cameras-at-karaj-facility) | [Media Advisory](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/iaea-director-general-to-hold-press-conference-17-december-2021), 15 December 2021 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/03/govinf2021-47.pdf), 15 December 2021\n\n**NOVEMBER 2021**\n\n**24 November 2021. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**Mr Grossi briefed the Board on his negotiations in Tehran on Saturday and on the series of actions agreed regarding the clarification and resolution of safeguards issues the Agency's Board identified in November 2021 and called on Iran to resolve. [Story](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/iaea-director-general-urges-iran-to-resolve-issues-related-to-four-undeclared-locations) | [Director General Statement](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-24-november-2021) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20230303191851/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72157719368421818) | [Photo Gallery: Press Briefing](https://web.archive.org/web/20230303191851/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72157719424236410) | [Media Advisory](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-24-26-november-2021), 22 November 2021 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/21/12/gov2021-52.pdf), 17 November 2021 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20230303191851/ht\n\n<error>Content truncated. Call the fetch tool with a start_index of 10000 to get more content.</error>"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
