{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":20000,"url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20231231000000/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/focus/iran/chronology-of-key-events"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://web.archive.org/web/20231231000000/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/focus/iran/chronology-of-key-events:\n**-2022-**\n\n**NOVEMBER 2022**\n\n**16 November 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**In his instroductory statement to the Agency's Board of Governors, IAEA Director General  Rafael Grossi provided an update on the Agency's verification and monitoring activities in Iran. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/iaea-director-general-briefs-board-of-governors-cop27-ukraine-and-iran) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-16-november-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720303734818) | [Photo Gallery: Press Briefing](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720303719816) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-16-18-november-2022), 11 November 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/govinf2022-22.pdf), 3 October 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/govinf2022-23.pdf), 10 October 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/gov2022-62.pdf), 10 November 2022 |[IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/11/gov2022-63.pdf), 10 November 2022\n\n**SEPTEMBER 2022**\n\n**12 September 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**In his instroductory statement to the Agency's Board of Governors, IAEA Director General  Rafael Grossi provided an update on the Agency's verification and monitoring activities in Iran. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-12-september-2022) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-12-september-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720302049078) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-12-16-september-2022), 9 September 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-13.pdf), 8 June 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-14.pdf), 9 June 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-15.pdf), 20 June 2022 |[IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-16.pdf), 9 July 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-17.pdf), 3 August 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-18.pdf), 29 August 2022 | [IAEA Boad Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/govinf2022-19.pdf), 31 August 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/gov2022-39.pdf), 7 September 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/09/gov2022-42.pdf), 7 September 2022\n\n**JUNE 2022**\n\n**8 June 2022. IAEA Board Adopts Resolution on Iran.** The IAEA Board of Governors adopted a resolution urging Iran to cooperate with the Agency. [Resolution](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-34.pdf)\n\n**6 June 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**The IAEA cannot confirm the correctness and completeness of Iran’s declarations under its Comprehensive Safeguards Agreement, Director General Rafael M. Grossi told the IAEA's Board of Governors. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/grossi-expresses-concern-to-iaea-board-about-safeguards-in-iran-nuclear-safety-security-and-safeguards-at-zaporizhzhya-nuclear-power-plant-in-ukraine) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-6-june-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720299573244) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-6-june), 2 June 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-26.pdf), 30 May 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-24.pdf), 30 May 2022 and [Corrigendum](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/gov2022-24c1.pdf), 6 June 2022 || [IAEA Board Report,](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-10.pdf) 16 April 2022 |  [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-11.pdf), 14 April 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-10.pdf), 6 April 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/06/govinf2022-8.pdf), 16 March 2022\n\n**MARCH 2022**\n\n**7 and 8 March 2022. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**Mr Grossi briefed the Board on his negotiations in Tehran on Saturday and on the series of actions agreed regarding the clarification and resolution of safeguards issues the Agency's Board identified in November 2021 and called on Iran to resolve. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/framework-for-the-safety-and-security-of-ukraines-nuclear-power-plants-must-be-agreed-iaea-director-general-tells-board-of-governors) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-7-march-2022) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72177720297182816) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-7-11-march-2022), 6 March 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/03/gov2022-5.pdf), 5 March 2022 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/03/gov2022-4.pdf), 3 March 2022\n\n**5 March 2022. Joint Statement by HE Mr Mohammad Eslami, Vice-President and President of the Atomic Energy Organization of Iran, and HE Mr Rafael Grossi, Director General of the International Atomic Energy Agency****.**The Vice-President of the Islamic Republic of Iran and President of the Atomic Energy Organization of Iran (AEOI) and the Director General of the International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) agreed on the following Joint Statement for the clarification of the issues mentioned in GOV/2021/52 of 17 November 2021. [Press Release](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/joint-statement-by-he-mr-mohammad-eslami-vice-president-and-president-of-the-atomic-energy-organization-of-iran-and-he-mr-rafael-grossi-director-general-of-the-international-atomic-energy-agency)\n\n**-2021-**\n\n**DECEMBER 2021**\n\n**15 December 2021. IAEA and Iran Reach Agreement on Replacing Surveillance Cameras at Karaj Facility.**The International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) will soon install new surveillance cameras at Iran’s Karaj centrifuge component manufacturing workshop under an agreement reached today by Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi and the Head of the Atomic Energy Organization of Iran, Mohammad Eslami. [Press Release](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/iaea-and-iran-reach-agreement-on-replacing-surveillance-cameras-at-karaj-facility) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/iaea-director-general-to-hold-press-conference-17-december-2021), 15 December 2021 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/22/03/govinf2021-47.pdf), 15 December 2021\n\n**NOVEMBER 2021**\n\n**24 November 2021. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**Mr Grossi briefed the Board on his negotiations in Tehran on Saturday and on the series of actions agreed regarding the clarification and resolution of safeguards issues the Agency's Board identified in November 2021 and called on Iran to resolve. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/iaea-director-general-urges-iran-to-resolve-issues-related-to-four-undeclared-locations) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-24-november-2021) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72157719368421818) | [Photo Gallery: Press Briefing](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72157719424236410) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-24-26-november-2021), 22 November 2021 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/21/12/gov2021-52.pdf), 17 November 2021 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/21/11/gov2021-51.pdf), 17 November 2021\n\n**SEPTEMBER 2021**\n\n**13 September 2021. IAEA Board of Governors September Meeting Begins.**In his instroductory statement to the Agency's Board of Governors, IAEA Director General  Rafael Grossi provided an update on the Agency's verification and monitoring activities in Iran. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/developments-with-iran-are-constructive-director-general-tells-iaea-board-of-governors) |  [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-13-september-2021) | [Video: Board of Governors](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/multimedia/videos/iaea-board-of-governors-news-video-september-2021) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-13-september-2021), 8 September 2019\n\n**12 September 2021**.**Joint Statement by the Vice-President and the Head of Atomic Energy Organization of the Islamic Republic of Iran and the Director General of the International Atomic Energy Agency**. A meeting between His Excellency Mr. Mohammad Eslami, Vice-President and the Head of Atomic Energy Organization of the Islamic Republic of Iran (AEOI) and IAEA Director General  Rafael Grossi took place on 12 September, during his visit to Tehran. [Press Release](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/joint-statement-by-the-vice-president-and-the-head-of-atomic-energy-organization-of-the-islamic-republic-of-iran-and-the-director-general-of-the-international-atomic-energy-agency)\n\n**MAY 2021**\n\n**24 May 2021**.**IAEA Director General Says Agreement Reached on Verification and Monitoring in Iran**. IAEA Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi said he had agreed with Iran to extend by one month the necessary verification and monitoring activities carried out by the Agency in the country. [Press Release](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/iaea-director-general-says-agreement-reached-on-verification-and-monitoring-in-iran)\n\n**MARCH 2021**\n\n**1 March 2021. IAEA Director General Briefs Board of Governors.**A recent technical understanding agreed with Iran among other issues were the focus of Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi’s statement to the IAEA’s Board of Governors. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/iran-covid-19-and-climate-change-iaea-director-general-briefs-board-of-governors) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-1-march-2021) | [Video: Board of Governors](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/multimedia/videos/iaea-board-of-governors-march-2021) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/collections/72157718444592522/) | [Photo Gallery: Press Conference](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/sets/72157718521150097/) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-1-march-2021), 24 February 2021\n\n**FEBRUARY 2021**\n\n**21 February 2021. Joint statement by the Vice-President of the Islamic Republic of Iran and Head of the AEOI and the Director General of the IAEA.**The Atomic Energy Organization of Iran (AEOI) and the International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) recalled and reaffirmed the spirit of cooperation and enhanced mutual trust that led to the[Joint Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/joint-statement-by-the-director-general-of-the-iaea-and-the-vice-president-of-the-islamic-republic-of-iran-and-head-of-the-aeoi) in Tehran on 26 August 2020, and the importance of continuing that cooperation and trust. [Press Release](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/joint-statement-by-the-vice-president-of-the-islamic-republic-of-iran-and-head-of-the-aeoi-and-the-director-general-of-the-iaea)\n\n**-2020-**\n\n**NOVEMBER 2020**\n\n**18 and 20 November 2020. IAEA Board of Governors Convenes November Meeting Virtually.**In his instroductory statement to the Agency's Board of Governors, Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi provided an update on the Agency's verification and monitoring activities in Iran. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/director-general-highlights-the-role-of-nuclear-technology-in-combatting-covid-19) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-18-november-2020) | [Video: Board of Governors](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/multimedia/videos/iaea-board-of-governors-20-november-2020), 20 November 2020 | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72157716935637423), 18 November 2020 | [Photo Gallery: Press Conference](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72157716936335186), 18 November 2020 | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/multimedia/videos/iaea-board-of-governors-20-november-2020), 20 November 2020 | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-18-november-2020), 16 November 2020 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/11/govinf2020-15.pdf), 9 October 2020 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/11/gov2020-51.pdf), 11 November 2020 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/11/govinf2020-16.pdf), 17 November 2020\n\n**SEPTEMBER 2020**\n\n**14 September 2020. IAEA Board of Governors September Meeting Begins.**In his instroductory statement to the Agency's Board of Governors, Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi provided an update on the Agency's verification and monitoring activities in Iran. [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/covid-19-response-remains-top-iaea-priority-director-general-says) | [Director General Statement](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/statements/iaea-director-generals-introductory-statement-to-the-board-of-governors-14-september-2020) | [Video: Board of Governors](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/multimedia/videos/iaea-board-of-governors-september-2020) | [Photo Gallery: Board of Governors](https://web.archive.org/web/20240114013044/https://www.flickr.com/photos/iaea_imagebank/albums/72157715965824948) | [Media Advisory](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/mediaadvisories/press-arrangements-for-iaea-board-of-governors-meeting-14-september-2020), 8 September 2020 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/09/govinf2020-10.pdf), 21 July 2020 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/09/govinf2020-41.pdf), 4 September 2020 | [IAEA Board Report](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/09/govinf2020-47.pdf), 4 September 2020\n\n**AUGUST 2020**\n\n**26 August 2020. Joint Statement by the Director General of the IAEA and the Vice-President of the Islamic Republic of Iran and Head of the AEOI.**The IAEA and the Islamic Republic of Iran agreed to further reinforce their cooperation and enhance mutual trust to facilitate the full implementation of Iran's Comprehensive Safeguards Agreement (CSA) and the Additional Protocol (AP) thereto, which is provisionally applied by Iran since 16 January 2016. [Press Release](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/joint-statement-by-the-director-general-of-the-iaea-and-the-vice-president-of-the-islamic-republic-of-iran-and-head-of-the-aeoi)\n\n**22 August 2020. IAEA Director General Grossi will Travel to Tehran on Monday.**IAEA Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi will travel to Tehran next Monday, 24 August, for meetings with high-level Iranian authorities. [Press Release](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/pressreleases/iaea-director-general-grossi-will-travel-to-tehran-on-monday)\n\n**JUNE 2020**\n\n**19 June 2020. IAEA Board Calls on Iran to Fully Implement its Safeguards Obligations.** The IAEA Board of Governors today adopted a resolution calling on the Islamic Republic of Iran to fully cooperate with the IAEA in implementing its NPT Safeguards Agreement and Additional Protocol and satisfy the IAEA's requests without further delay. (NPT refers to the [Treaty on the Non-Proliferation of Nuclear Weapons](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/publications/documents/treaties/npt)). [Story](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/iaea-board-calls-on-iran-to-fully-implement-its-safeguards-obligations) | [IAEA Board Report (GOV/2020/15)](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/06/gov2020-15.pdf), 19 June 2020 | [IAEA Board Report (GOV/2020/30)](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/06/gov2020-30.pdf), 19 June 2020 | [Resolution (GOV/2020/34)](/web/20240114013044/https://www.iaea.org/sites/default/files/20/06/gov2020-34.pdf), 19 June 2020\n\n**15 June 2020. Despite Lockdown, IAEA Continues Nuclear Verification and Supports Countries Fighting COVID-19 in Largest Ever Operation, Director General Tells Agency's Board.**In his statement to the Agency's Board of Governors concerning safeguards implementation in Iran, IAEA Director General Rafael Mariano Grossi said: \"I note with serious concern that, for over four mont\n\n<error>Content truncated. Call the fetch tool with a start_index of 20000 to get more content.</error>"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
