[Sayyed Razi Mousavi](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sayyed_Razi_Mousavi \"Sayyed Razi Mousavi\") is killed in an [Israeli](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israel \"Israel\") [airstrike](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airstrike \"Airstrike\") in Syria.[[25]](#cite_note-25)\n* 29 December – Four people are [executed](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capital_punishment \"Capital punishment\") by [hanging](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanging \"Hanging\") in [West Azerbaijan province](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Azerbaijan_province \"West Azerbaijan province\"), after being convicted for links to [Israel](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israel \"Israel\")’s [Mossad](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mossad \"Mossad\") spy agency.[[26]](#cite_note-26)\n\n* 7 January\n  + [Mohammad Mehdi Karami](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Execution_of_Mohammad_Mehdi_Karami \"Execution of Mohammad Mehdi Karami\"), 21[[27]](#cite_note-:2-27)[[28]](#cite_note-:5-28)\n  + [Seyyed Mohammad Hosseini](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Execution_of_Mohammad_Hosseini \"Execution of Mohammad Hosseini\"), 39\n* 7 June – [The Iron Sheik](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Iron_Sheik \"The Iron Sheik\"), 81[[29]](#cite_note-29)\n* 9 June - [Firouz Naderi](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firouz_Naderi \"Firouz Naderi\"), 77\n\n1. [↑](#cite_ref-1) [\"۵۰۰واحد مسکونی خوی خسارت دید/ ۱۹۴ نفر مصدوم شدند\"](https://www.mehrnews.com/news/5686019/%DB%B5%DB%B0%DB%B0%D9%88%D8%A7%D8%AD%D8%AF-%D9%85%D8%B3%DA%A9%D9%88%D9%86%DB%8C-%D8%AE%D9%88%DB%8C-%D8%AE%D8%B3%D8%A7%D8%B1%D8%AA-%D8%AF%DB%8C%D8%AF-%DB%B1%DB%B9%DB%B4-%D9%86%D9%81%D8%B1-%D9%85%D8%B5%D8%AF%D9%88%D9%85-%D8%B4%D8%AF%D9%86%D8%AF) [500 residential units were damaged/ 194 people were injured]. *Mehr News Agency* (in Persian). 2023-01-18. Retrieved 2023-01-24.\n2. [↑](#cite_ref-2) Shin, Hyonhee (2023-01-19). [\"South Korea, Iran summon each other's envoys as spat over Yoon remarks deepens\"](https://www.reuters.com/world/south-korea-envoy-iran-summoned-over-yoons-enemy-remarks-media-2023-01-19/). *Reuters*. Retrieved 2023-01-24.\n3. [↑](#cite_ref-3) [\"Two police officers killed in armed attack in Iran's southeast: State media\"](https://english.alarabiya.net/News/middle-east/2023/01/24/Two-police-officers-killed-in-armed-attack-in-Iran-s-southeast-State-media). *Al Arabiya English*. 2023-01-24. Retrieved 2023-01-24.\n4. [↑](#cite_ref-4) [\"One person dies in attack on Azerbaijan's embassy in Iran\"](https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2023/1/27/armed-attack-azerbaijan-embassy-iran-kills). *Aljazeera*. Retrieved 2023-01-27.\n5. [↑](#cite_ref-5) [\"Iran says drone attack targets defense facility in Isfahan\"](https://apnews.com/article/iran-government-business-drones-2ea4c51f7be1e377b95d1fccc1c963ad). *AP NEWS*. 2023-01-29. Retrieved 2023-01-29.\n6. [↑](#cite_ref-6) [\"Iran acknowledges accusation it enriched uranium to 84%\"](https://www.yahoo.com/now/iran-acknowledges-accusation-enriched-uranium-093144563.html). *Yahoo*. 23 February 2023. Retrieved 2023-02-23.\n7. [↑](#cite_ref-7) [\"Heavy rains in Iran trigger flash floods, killing at least 2\"](https://apnews.com/article/iran-rains-flash-floods-4156a5bb9ce962a09db12328ae00c905). *AP NEWS*. 2023-04-13. Retrieved 2023-05-22.\n8. [↑](#cite_ref-8) [\"Iran installs cameras in public places to identify, penalise unveiled women\"](https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/iran-installs-cameras-public-places-identify-penalise-unveiled-women-police-2023-04-08/). *Reuters*. 2023-04-11. Retrieved 2023-05-22.\n9. [↑](#cite_ref-9) [\"Iran Claims Its Navy Forced U.S. Submarine To Surface As It Entered The Gulf\"](https://www.rferl.org/a/iran-us-submarine-surface-gulf/32372099.html). *RadioFreeEurope/RadioLiberty*. Reuters. Retrieved 2023-05-22.\n10. [↑](#cite_ref-10) [\"Labor Strikes In Iran Continue For Third Consecutive Day\"](https://www.iranintl.com/en/202304242738). *Iran International*. 2023-05-22. Retrieved 2023-05-22.\n11. [↑](#cite_ref-11) [\"Iran: Senior Shia cleric on Assembly of Experts shot dead at bank\"](https://www.bbc.com/news/world-middle-east-6