*. 2023-09-03. Retrieved 2023-09-05.\n20. [↑](#cite_ref-20) [\"Iran's security forces crack down on protests a year after Mahsa Amini's death\"](https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/irans-security-forces-detain-mahsa-aminis-father-anniversary-her-death-rights-2023-09-16/). *Reuters*. 2023-09-17. Retrieved 2023-09-18.\n21. [↑](#cite_ref-21) Mills, Andrew (2023-09-18). [\"Five US citizens land in Qatar as part of US-Iran prisoner swap\"](https://www.reuters.com/world/south-korea-working-unfreeze-tehrans-funds-us-iran-detainee-deal-2023-09-18/). *Reuters*. Retrieved 2023-09-18.\n22. [↑](#cite_ref-22) [\"Dozens killed in blaze at drug rehab centre in Iran\"](https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/nov/03/dozens-killed-in-blaze-at-drug-rehab-centre-in-iran). *The Guardian*. Agence France-Presse. 2023-11-03. [ISSN](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier) \"ISSN (identifier)\") [0261-3077](https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0261-3077). Retrieved 2023-11-03.\n23. [↑](#cite_ref-23) [\"Iran executes 'Mossad agent' convicted of spying for Israel\"](https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20231216-iran-executes-mossad-agent-convicted-of-spying-for-israel). *France 24*. 2023-12-16. Retrieved 2023-12-18.\n24. [↑](#cite_ref-24) [\"What to Know About the Cyber Attack on Iran's Gas Stations\"](https://time.com/6548680/iran-hacker-gas-station-cyberattack-israel/). *Time*. 2023-12-18. Retrieved 2023-12-18.\n25. [↑](#cite_ref-25) [\"Israeli strike in Syria kills Iranian commander, Iran says\"](https://www.bbc.com/news/world-middle-east-67820538). 2023-12-25. Retrieved 2023-12-26.\n26. [↑](#cite_ref-26) [\"Iran says it executes four people accused of links to Israel's Mossad\"](https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2023/12/29/iran-says-it-executed-four-people-accused-of-links-to-israels-mossad). *Al Jazeera*. Retrieved 2023-12-29.\n27. [↑](#cite_ref-:2_27-0) Mahmood, Zahid; Alkhaldi, Celine; Elbagir, Nima (2022-12-23). [\"Exclusive: Iranian footballer is among dozens facing execution while the West is distracted by Christmas, supporters fear\"](https://www.cnn.com/2022/12/23/middleeast/iran-footballer-amir-nasr-azadani-execution-intl/index.html). *[CNN](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CNN \"CNN\")*. [Archived](https://web.archive.org/web/20230110032533/https://www.cnn.com/2022/12/23/middleeast/iran-footballer-amir-nasr-azadani-execution-intl/index.html) from the original on 2023-01-10. Retrieved 2023-01-10.\n28. [↑](#cite_ref-:5_28-0) Fassihi, Farnaz (2023-01-07). [\"Iran Executes 2 Men Arrested in Protests\"](https://www.nytimes.com/2023/01/07/world/middleeast/iran-executes-protesters.html). *The New York Times*. [ISSN](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier) \"ISSN (identifier)\") [0362-4331](https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0362-4331). [Archived](https://web.archive.org/web/20230110035435/https://www.nytimes.com/2023/01/07/world/middleeast/iran-executes-protesters.html) from the original on 2023-01-10. Retrieved 2023-01-10.\n29. [↑](#cite_ref-29) Li, David K. (2023-06-07). [\"The Iron Sheik, pro wrestling legend and social media star, dies at 81\"](https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/iron-sheik-wrestling-legend-social-media-star-dies-81-rcna88160). *www.nbcnews.com*. Retrieved 2023-06-07."}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
