{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_56","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":10000,"url":"https://english.khamenei.ir/news/8999"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://english.khamenei.ir/news/8999:\nMay 25, 2022\n\n#### Photos\n\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28023.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28023.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28024.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28024.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28025.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28025.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28026.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28026.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28027.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28027.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28029.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28029.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28021.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28021.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28028.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28028.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![cleric martyrs](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28022.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28022.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"cleric martyrs\")\n[![Cleric Martyrs_Head 2](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/2/28020.jpg?ts=1728467047000)](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/05/25/4/28020.jpg?ts=1728467047000 \"Cleric Martyrs_Head 2\")\n\n## Comment"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
