{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_80","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":10000,"url":"https://english.khamenei.ir/news/9138"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://english.khamenei.ir/news/9138:\nThe Islamic Republic has always also stood with people who aren't Shia but are on a right path. In the Muslim world, who has helped Palestine as much as Iran? Countries with the same religious denomination as Palestine didn't help a hundredth of that. At times they even inflict harms.\n\n[![](http://english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/09/03/3/28985.jpg)](https://cdn-english.khamenei.ir/d/2022/09/03/0/28984.jpg)\n\n\nClick on the image to view the large size"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
